{"id":"4aa9b38cae202a0a","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-commutativity.md","title":"Commutativity","display":"df-commutativity — Commutativity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-commutativity","aliases":["58-df-commutativity"],"display":"df-commutativity — Commutativity","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-commutativity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-commutativity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-commutativity — Commutativity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\\in V\">\\(\\star\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)\\)</span> (binary-operation graph, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)\\)</span> (commutativity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutativity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\star(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\star(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutativity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\star(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\star(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Commutativity is symmetry of a binary operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\star\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)$ (binary-operation graph, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\star\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutativity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutative}_S(A,\\star)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,A\\times A,A)\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\star(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\star(\\langle y,x\\rangle)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":766,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Commutative}_S$ (commutativity predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md|58-df-comm